*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# === System and metadata files ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# === Archive/Package files ===
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.deb
*.rpm

